me years later, taking me to my first love: Mage the Awakening.<br /> I love the new, I love Exalted though I never had the opportunity to play it seriously. My favourite NWoD games are: Mage, Were...wait. Fuck this shit. I love them all.<br /> I don't like the classical World of Darkness at all.<br /> I converted D&amp;D to the World of Darkness/God Machine Chronicle at the White Wolf forum, and I posted it here in those forums.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/316-jesuncolo","name":"Jesuncolo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar316_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-05T11:47:09-08:00","id":3651,"title":"","content":"Hi, I'm Michael, unblack metal fan, gamer, and genteel plebian-philosopher.<br /> <br /> My gaming interests mostly revolve around Vampire the Requiem, Scion, Pathfinder/3.5 D&amp;D, and Changeling the Lost","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thinking as I do that the Creator of this World is a very Cruel Being &amp; being a Worshipper of Christ, I cannot help saying: &quot;the Son, O how unlike the Father!&quot; First God Almighty comes with a Thump on the Head. Then Jesus Christ comes with a balm to heal it. - William Blake, Christian mystic and visionary","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/774-pilgrim","name":"Pilgrim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar774_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-05T14:49:51-08:00","id":3773,"title":"","content":"Hello, my name is Sorwen and I'm an alcoholic. It has been 6 years since my last confession(I think, it is all a drunken haze). I like Vampire the Dark Ages and long walks off short piers. I weigh too much and my favorite color is onion. My favorite vegetable is black and I don't like the smell of cut grass.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forever and always forward.<br /> Don't ask why that came to mind or that I felt the need to post it.<br /> I see the incorporeally challenged.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/787-sorwen","name":"Sorwen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-05T22:07:46-08:00","id":4038,"title":"","content":"lol my name is sally, i'm 21/female/arkansas and i luv luv luuuuuuv anime and dnd and Good fucking god it is hard to act like a horny dumbass teenager after the fact.<br /> <br /> Let's try this again. I'm Arcane, I implore you, call me Arc unless it's serious, and either you already know me well enough to know my insecurities(And real name), you'll interact with me long enough to figure it out, or I suppose you'll be curious enough to actually push me to introduce myself. If you aren't any of those three types, well, Arc's enough for you.<br /> <br /> I am not a potato. That would be Sikker.<br /> <br /> PS: I wonder if we can preemptively ban Blood Lore.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 11-06-2013, 01:12 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-06T04:15:14-08:00","id":4201,"title":"","content":"The name's Jess and I'm from the Southern US. Moved to Norway once I married my Norwegian sweetie of six and a half years. We live out in the country and have two cats. There's the family farm cat that lives here in the area ( we live next door to the mother in law ) and he's taken to coming over to our place since we moved in....just inviting himself in to make himself comfortable. So we kinda have three cats...<br /> <br /> My experiences with tabletop gaming is extremely small...well, okay..doesn't really exist. I like the stuff but I end up more using it for ideas in writing and just for fun since I can't be around people very long at a time to even consider being in a gaming group. Though playing other games......I play a few MMOs, have a few PC games and used to have games for the N64, PS1, GBC and SNES. Currently have a DSi XL and a few games with it.<br /> <br /> Um...hmm...not sure what else to say. Ah well, that's enough for now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i><span style=\"color:darkred\">Got an angel on the left hand and a devil on the right<br /> She's gonna raise a little hell up in heaven tonight---Vixen</span></i></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:olive\"><i>When you say it's all divine and meant to be<br /> What about your flesh and blood and defiers like me?---Avantasia</i></span></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/821-rayvin-miyu","name":"Rayvin Miyu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar821_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-13T17:24:05-08:00","id":10090,"title":"","content":"My name is Chris and I have been playing V:tM for over 20 years. I started gaming at the tender age of 8 with D&amp;D then Talislanta and finally V:tM in 1991. I have played many games including Star Drive, All Flesh Must Be Eaten, Iron Kingdoms, L5R and many others I have since forgotten. I always come back to vampire as my go to game where I am the most<br /> comfortable. I have many more cats then what should be allowed by law, so my house is literally a cat sanctuary. It is kind of fun being a slave to these cats always doing their bidding. That is about it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1090-tobias","name":"Tobias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1090_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-13T19:47:48-08:00","id":10148,"title":"","content":"My name is Max but people know me better as Wizard, TDW, The Dark Wizard. I own RPdom.com a RPing community where anyone can run any game they want and exalted became huge on our community.<br /> <br /> I'm known for some of the resources I've provided to the community over the years but I only recently attached a name to them, I really did not participate in the WW forums until this year. I am also the man working on WhiteWolfArchive.com since I know some of you know about that(Yes its almost done, should be another few days).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2095-white-wolf-archive-coming-soon\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2095-white-wolf-archive-coming-soon\"> White Wolf Archive Coming Soon - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2095-white-wolf-archive-coming-soon\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/2095-white-wolf-archive-coming-soon </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> After contacting Eddy Webb about it. I have purchased and will be launching in the next few days http://www.whitewolfarchive.com (http://www.whitewolfarchive.com/) as soon I'm done downloading all the public content on the forums. Hope this turns out to be useful for anyone who wants an archive to stay </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> If you ever need anything just let me know and do not hesitate to contact me <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.rpdom.com\" target=\"_blank\">RPdom.com</a> (Come host your game with us <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />!)| <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">White Wolf Forum Archive</a> | <a href=\"http://www.rpdom.com/resources/categories/exalted.2/\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Resources</a> (800+ including TAW Lunars) | <a href=\"http://www.rpdom.com/dice\" target=\"_blank\">Online Exalted Dice</a> | And much more!<br /> <br /> All services provided for free by RPdom, for all your RPing needs!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/279-the-dark-wizard","name":"The Dark Wizard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar279_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-13T21:37:23-08:00","id":10190,"title":"","content":"I forgot to mention that I am a co-founder of a skype gaming group that meets nearly everyday over skype. We have about 30 members though not all of them play. If anyone is interested shoot me a PM and I can get you into a V20 game pretty quick. We use Roll20.net for all of our virtual table and dice rolling needs. It is a wonderful program and I recommend it to everyone who plays online.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1090-tobias","name":"Tobias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1090_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}